{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18927","headline":"分司东都蒙襄阳李司徒相公书问因以奉寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"分司东都蒙襄阳李司徒相公书问因以奉寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早忝金马客，晚爲商洛翁。\n知名四海内，多病一生中。\n举世往还尽，何人心事同。\n几时登岘首，恃旧揖三公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}